## 🧨 8. Error Handling (Common)

|Error|Meaning|
|---|---|
|`P2002`|Unique constraint failed|
|`P2025`|Record not found|
|`P1001`|Database not reachable|

You can catch Prisma errors like:

```ts
try {
  await prisma.user.create({ data: ... });
} catch (e) {
  if (e.code === 'P2002') console.log('Email already exists');
}
```

---

## 🧩 9. `select` vs `include`

|Keyword|Purpose|
|---|---|
|`select`|Only return specific fields|
|`include`|Fetch related data (relations)|

Example:

```ts
await prisma.user.findUnique({
  where: { id: 1 },
  select: { id: true, email: true },
});

await prisma.user.findUnique({
  where: { id: 1 },
  include: { posts: true },
});
```

